<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
Vera: Whew, oh man. I thought we were absolutely done for. 
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: ….!
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
Vera: Whew, oh man. I thought we were absolutely done for. 
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
Elsie: What… I’m all out of elixir...
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: What?! 
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: Pff… I’m just sayin… Did you really give it your all?
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: Do you ever shut that mouth of yours??
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: I’d worry more about yours. You’ll be missing a couple teeth soon, pretty boy.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
Elsie: O-oh no! Lili… You’re still bleeding…!
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: Hm?
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
Elsie: Mmph…
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: A-ack! That stings… Those damn leeches got me good.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: THIS STORY IS IN PROGRESS
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>
<<HQ DialogueSystem>>
