title:Lose
---
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Damnit>>
Dahlia: <b>DAMMIT!</b>
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Angry>>
Loveday: The technique was impeccable… just how did the guy swing like that? 
<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Disgust>>
Dahlia: Loveday, you got snot comin’ out your nose.
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: Oh. Uhh.
Loveday: Vera. Fetch me a tissue.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Agree>>
Vera: On it!
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Coonfused>>
Vera: Actually, where am I supposed to find that... haha...
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Realize>>
Loveday: Whatever. I’ll just use this tissue I found on the floor.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
Elsie: <b>GAHHHH!!!</b>
Elsie: <b>T-THAT’S MY ARM, YOU FREAK!!!</b>
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Serious>>
Dahlia: Enough. 
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Pleased>>
Dahlia: Elsie. Here’s your arm back. 
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Annoyed>>
Loveday: This little freak can pick it up herself.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
Elsie: It just feels better when Lili does it… heheheh…
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Frustrated>>
Vera: Ughhhhhh… I’m bored. Are we gonna go back out yet?
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_ComeOn>>
Loveday: Yeah. We’ll be back on our feet in no time.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<HQ DialogueSystem>>

