title:Pregame
---
<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Confused>>
Vera: Now I could’ve sworn that big, tall tree was right here…
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
<< PlaySound audio Loveday_ComeOn>>
Loveday: Vera, give me that map. Why did we even let you guide the way??
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Awkward>>
Dahlia: ‘Cause she’s the closest we’re going to get to an actual surveyor. 
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Yeah>>
Vera: Hey! I’m the real deal!
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieScaredR">>
Elsie: Ngh… how long is this going to take…?
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: Not too much longer, I promise.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

//<< PlayElsieCutscene elsiecutscene>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieScaredR">>
Elsie: I swear it’s been days since we rested! My feet are gonna fall off!
Elsie: Lili, carry me?
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaHappyL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Pleased>>
Dahlia: Hop on my back.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Annoyed>>
Loveday: Quit being a spoiled brat.
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
Loveday: Aren’t you the one with infinite limbs? Why not just chop them off and regrow them if they hurt so bad?
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Agree>>
Vera: Elsie has a point though. I <i>am</i> starting to feel the hungies… hehe.
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Damnit>>
Dahlia: Are you KIDDING ME??! You just sucked the last remaining blood pouches we had an hour ago!
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
Loveday: Haven’t you been a vampire longer than me and Dahlia? How’s your hunger still so insatiable? Haven’t you starved enough?
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Wow>>
Vera: Hey… it’s been years since I ate this good.
Vera: But check out all this energy that tasty blood gave me! WHEEEE!!!
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Curious>>
Dahlia: And… she ran off.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Agree>>
Loveday: Oh…my… Well. Forget it. It’s not like anyone knows that I broke the rules.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Awkward>>
Dahlia: You broke rules? What rules?
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Realize>>
Loveday: Ahem. I’m referring to the first rule in the <i>Squad Communing Handbook.</i> “Rule 1: Squad leaders must attempt to keep all squad members within eyeshot.”
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
Dahlia: Boi you broke the next five too, if I’m reading things corre-
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
Loveday: “Rule 67: Squad leader is permitted to backhand ill-tempered squad members at any time without warning.”
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Disgust>>
Dahlia: Oh okay, really funny. We got a funny guy over here. Hello? Guards? We need to apprehend this guy for being wayyyy too funny!
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieBaseR">>
Elsie: A-Are there any rules about stopping scary mean people from arguing???
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Yeah>>
Vera: <b>HEYY!! HEYYY GUYSSSS!!!</b> I think I see the forest clearing up ahead!
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: Okay. I’m gonna yell, guys. First time yelling. Let me know how it sounds.
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Angry>>
Loveday: <b>WOW, I NEVER DOUBTED YOU VERA.</b>
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Yeah>>
Vera: <b>GREAT YELL, SIR, YES SIR!!!</b>
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>


<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: Elsie, do you have all the bottles? There’s someone I know here that’s willing to sell us some elixir.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieScaredR">>
Elsie: Y-yes… is this really okay?
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: What's okay?
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieBaseR">>
Elsie: You know… picking fights with the Claredon guards?
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayBaseL">>
Loveday: Don't go back on your word now.
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Annoyed>>
Loveday: And Elsie- you’re FROM Claredon. You know their inner workings the best. 
<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<< PlaySound audio Loveday_ComeOn>>
Loveday: Prepare yourselves. This is just the beginning.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<< PlaySound audio Dahlia_Disgust>>
Dahlia: Don’t have to tell me twice.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Agree>>
Vera: I’m ready and raring to go!
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieBaseR">>
Elsie: …Okay…
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>


<<HQ DialogueSystem>>
