title:Lose2
---
<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Yeah>>
Vera: Oh YEAH!!! We lost, but I’m sooo pumped! <b>HAHAHAHHAHA!</b>
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Angry>>
Loveday: Damn it all to hell.
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaBaseL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Awkward>>
Dahlia: Aren’t you just a little ray of sunshine…
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieBaseR">>
Elsie: I-It’s probably because we didn’t buy enough items or something…
<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieMadR">>
Elsie: Lawrence… stop glaring at me.
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Annoyed>>
Loveday: If we <b>BOUGHT</b> anything it would’ve been <b>EATEN</b> by Vera. 
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraScaredR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Confused>>
Vera: Okay so-
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaMadL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Disgust>>
Dahlia: They’re still out there. So we gotta go. 
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieScaredR">>
Elsie: Ngh… Won’t a super tawll and stwong woman come here and help a sad, pathetic widdle me…??
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaHappyL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Pleased>>
Dahlia: You hurting all over again? Here, lemme help you. 
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieHappyR">>
Elsie: Oh. Hehe, okay! Hehehehehe… I’m blushing…
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "DahliaHappyL">>
<<PlaySound audio Dahlia_Pleased>>
Dahlia: Hup!
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>


<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "ElsieHappyR">>
Elsie: Hehehe… Lili’s giving me uppies… I should let those vampires cut me up more often.
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageRight PortraitContainerRight "VeraHappyR">>
<<PlaySound audio Vera_Wow>>
Vera: OK GUYS! I’m going to sing a PORT CONCETTA CLASSIC for you all to get our hopes up again!
Vera: <i> Port Concetta, Port Concetta, oh how I love you so~ </i>
<<resetScaleRight PortraitContainerRight>>

<<changeNPCImageLeft PortraitContainerLeft "LovedayScaredL">>
<<PlaySound audio Loveday_Disgust>>
Loveday: Where are a pair of earmuffs when I need them…
<<resetScaleLeft PortraitContainerLeft>>
<<HQ DialogueSystem>>

